            r"Computed version: with disk-grid approximations $\widetilde\theta^\pm_k$ of $\zeta^{\pm k}$ (error below $2\cdot2^{-p}$, cost $O(p^{1+\delta})$ per factor), form $f'=Q_p(\widetilde\theta^+\cdot f)$, $g'=Q_p(\widetilde\theta^+\cdot g)$, $h'=\widetilde{\mathcal M}_r(\iota f',\iota g')$ and output $Q_p(\widetilde\theta^-\cdot\iota^{-1}h')$, at total twist cost $O(Tp^{1+\delta})$.",
