        inf("S7.6",
            r"The synthetic component width is instantiated as $w=w_{\rm c}=p+2\le2p$ ($C_w=2$), so $\iota$ and $\iota^{-1}$ only change the shape descriptor and need no payload movement, and the output of width $w_M$ is normalized back to $w_{\rm c}$ by removing leading sign-extension bits in $O(Tp)$.",
            r"Before applying $\iota^{-1}$, scan each"),
